    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "to understand causality. The Buddha said",
    "start": 2177.52,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "to understand, you know, to know the",
    "start": 2180.24,
    "duration": 5.839
  },
  {
    "text": "dharmas to know causality.",
    "start": 2182.24,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "In other words, we start telling",
    "start": 2186.079,
    "duration": 5.121
  },
  {
    "text": "stories.",
    "start": 2188.8,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "Pattern is certain kind of story.",
    "start": 2191.2,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "But our stories, the stories we tell are",
    "start": 2195.44,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "much better than the stories we used to",
    "start": 2198.4,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "tell. They are richer.",
    "start": 2200.56,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "Our stories are less brittle. Dharma",
    "start": 2204.16,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "stories are not brittle.",
    "start": 2207.04,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "Brittle stories hold a lot of egoic",
    "start": 2209.76,
    "duration": 8.72
  },
  {
    "text": "um energy in place.",
    "start": 2214.16,
    "duration": 7.919
  },
  {
    "text": "Brittle stories cannot be challenged by",
    "start": 2218.48,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "another person, another view, because",
    "start": 2222.079,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "they hold a ton of feeling in place.",
    "start": 2224.72,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "They're charged with egoic investment.",
    "start": 2228.079,
    "duration": 7.641
  },
  {
    "text": "This is what's so.",
    "start": 2231.76,
    "duration": 3.96
  },
  {
    "text": "And for a long time, our stories can aid",
    "start": 2235.839,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "and abet our habits of",
    "start": 2239.68,
    "duration": 8.159
  },
  {
    "text": "avoidance, of delusion.",
    "start": 2243.839,
    "duration": 8.481
  },
  {
    "text": "And part of this movement from data to",
    "start": 2247.839,
    "duration": 7.121
  },
  {
    "text": "information to knowledge, part of the",
    "start": 2252.32,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "evolution of our stories, the capacity",
    "start": 2254.96,
    "duration": 7.44
  },
  {
    "text": "to speak about our inner life,",
    "start": 2258.64,
    "duration": 8.719
  },
  {
    "text": "about joy and sorrow and hope and fear",
    "start": 2262.4,
    "duration": 7.84
  },
  {
    "text": "and shame, all of it. to be able to",
    "start": 2267.359,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "speak about all of that fluently.",
    "start": 2270.24,
    "duration": 7.879
  },
  {
    "text": "Fluently",
    "start": 2275.119,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "the fluid stories can bend to include",
    "start": 2280.24,
    "duration": 6.76
  },
  {
    "text": "the views of others.",
    "start": 2283.2,
    "duration": 3.8
  },
  {
    "text": "They are stories live alongside the",
    "start": 2287.119,
    "duration": 6.801
  },
  {
    "text": "permanent possibility of being wrong.",
    "start": 2290.72,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "They're nuance. They're not",
    "start": 2293.92,
    "duration": 5.56
  },
  {
    "text": "fundamentalist stories.",
    "start": 2295.52,
    "duration": 3.96
  },
  {
    "text": "Brittle stories",
    "start": 2299.92,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "uh have a kind of defensive function.",
    "start": 2302.64,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "Dharma stories",
    "start": 2307.28,
    "duration": 7.88
  },
  {
    "text": "contuce towards silence.",
    "start": 2309.76,
    "duration": 5.4
  },
  {
    "text": "It's not that we elevate silence over",
    "start": 2317.68,
    "duration": 8.08
  },
  {
    "text": "story but dharma stories move",
    "start": 2321.28,
    "duration": 7.92
  },
  {
    "text": "towards silence.",
    "start": 2325.76,
    "duration": 3.44
  },
  {
    "text": "And they privilege",
    "start": 2329.68,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "the patterns we notice, the information",
    "start": 2332.24,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "that we gather, the the the knowledge we",
    "start": 2335.28,
    "duration": 6.799
  },
  {
    "text": "begin to weave, privileges, the most",
    "start": 2338.72,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "fundamental distinction, suffering",
    "start": 2342.079,
    "duration": 8.921
  },
  {
    "text": "and non-suffering, suffering and peace.",
    "start": 2345.92,
    "duration": 5.08
  },
  {
    "text": "Ordinarily our our stories are all about",
    "start": 2352.72,
    "duration": 7.84
  },
  {
    "text": "self and other praise and blame,",
    "start": 2355.839,
    "duration": 9.361
  },
  {
    "text": "good and evil. And now all of those uh",
    "start": 2360.56,
    "duration": 8.96
  },
  {
    "text": "distinctions bow to the much more useful",
    "start": 2365.2,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "investigation",
    "start": 2369.52,
    "duration": 4.4
  },
  {
    "text": "pattern",
    "start": 2372.16,
    "duration": 7.16
  },
  {
    "text": "about suffering and its causes.",
    "start": 2373.92,
    "duration": 5.4
  },
  {
    "text": "And",
    "start": 2379.92,
    "duration": 7.28
  },
  {
    "text": "the the um the the Budda said like just",
    "start": 2382.4,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "as a lion rules over the wild, wisdom",
    "start": 2387.2,
    "duration": 6.399
  },
  {
    "text": "rules over all other spiritual",
    "start": 2390.4,
    "duration": 5.439
  },
  {
    "text": "faculties.",
    "start": 2393.599,
    "duration": 4.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Wisdom.",
    "start": 2395.839,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "Okay. This movement from from knowledge",
    "start": 2397.599,
    "duration": 8.801
  },
  {
    "text": "to wisdom. Wisdom as realization.",
    "start": 2401.599,
    "duration": 7.921
  },
  {
    "text": "Wisdom is typically defined as realizing",
    "start": 2406.4,
    "duration": 4.959
  },
  {
    "text": "the four noble truths that there's",
    "start": 2409.52,
    "duration": 3.68
  },
  {
    "text": "suffering, there's a cause, there's an",
    "start": 2411.359,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "end, there's a path leading to the end",
    "start": 2413.2,
    "duration": 7.159
  },
  {
    "text": "of suffering.",
    "start": 2417.119,
    "duration": 3.24
  },
  {
    "text": "And so wisdom,",
    "start": 2421.44,
    "duration": 6.159
  },
  {
    "text": "wisdom in other words has primarily been",
    "start": 2424.4,
    "duration": 7.679
  },
  {
    "text": "tied to explanation,",
    "start": 2427.599,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "explaining",
    "start": 2432.079,
    "duration": 4.561
  },
  {
    "text": "how suffering arises",
    "start": 2433.839,
    "duration": 6.201
  },
  {
    "text": "and ceases,",
    "start": 2436.64,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "explanation.",
    "start": 2441.76,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "But there's a capacity related to",
    "start": 2444.96,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "explanation.",
    "start": 2447.599,
    "duration": 5.601
  },
  {
    "text": "It's not identical to it,",
    "start": 2449.92,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "but I associate it even more closely",
    "start": 2453.2,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "with with wisdom,",
    "start": 2456.88,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "which is rather than explanation,",
    "start": 2459.68,
    "duration": 5.48
  },
  {
    "text": "prediction.",
    "start": 2462.16,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "No matter what your world view, no",
    "start": 2467.28,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "matter how wild or different it is,",
    "start": 2469.28,
    "duration": 7.039
  },
  {
    "text": "if you can predict something,",
    "start": 2472.88,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm very interested.",
    "start": 2476.319,
    "duration": 6.76
  },
  {
    "text": "That's very compelling.",
    "start": 2478.96,
    "duration": 4.119
  },
  {
    "text": "And wisdom",
    "start": 2484.48,
    "duration": 6.879
  },
  {
    "text": "is the capacity to predict deep",
    "start": 2486.8,
    "duration": 7.559
  },
  {
    "text": "happiness,",
    "start": 2491.359,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "not mere pleasure.",
    "start": 2494.56,
    "duration": 3.68
  },
  {
    "text": "Not merely for self but for others too.",
    "start": 2498.64,
    "duration": 6.04
  },
  {
    "text": "Timothy um Wilson psycho psychologist",
    "start": 2507.119,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "says many cultures have myths in which",
    "start": 2510.8,
    "duration": 4.64
  },
  {
    "text": "people can make their dreams uh their",
    "start": 2513.119,
    "duration": 5.441
  },
  {
    "text": "wishes come true. Common to these myths",
    "start": 2515.44,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "is the notion that if people could make",
    "start": 2518.56,
    "duration": 3.519
  },
  {
    "text": "their wishes come true they will achieve",
    "start": 2520.16,
    "duration": 4.56
  },
  {
    "text": "everlasting happiness.",
    "start": 2522.079,
    "duration": 4.081
  },
  {
    "text": "Sometimes however people are",
    "start": 2524.72,
    "duration": 3.68
  },
  {
    "text": "disappointed by the very things they",
    "start": 2526.16,
    "duration": 4.24
  },
  {
    "text": "think they want.",
    "start": 2528.4,
    "duration": 4.959
  },
  {
    "text": "Research on a effect of forecasting has",
    "start": 2530.4,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "shown that people routinely mispredict",
    "start": 2533.359,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "how much pleasure and displeasure future",
    "start": 2536.24,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "events will bring. As a result sometimes",
    "start": 2540.319,
    "duration": 5.841
  },
  {
    "text": "work about work to bring about events",
    "start": 2543.76,
    "duration": 5.599
  },
  {
    "text": "that do not maximize their happiness.",
    "start": 2546.16,
    "duration": 5.439
  },
  {
    "text": "They go on to conclude, \"Finding ways to",
    "start": 2549.359,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "increase the accuracy of a effective",
    "start": 2551.599,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "emotional forecast is a worthy",
    "start": 2555.359,
    "duration": 6.161
  },
  {
    "text": "enterprise, though not, we suspect, a",
    "start": 2557.839,
    "duration": 8.361
  },
  {
    "text": "particularly easy one.",
    "start": 2561.52,
    "duration": 4.68
  },
  {
    "text": "Can we",
    "start": 2567.44,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "predict what is",
    "start": 2570.24,
    "duration": 8.04
  },
  {
    "text": "truly good for our hearts?",
    "start": 2573.76,
    "duration": 4.52
  },
  {
    "text": "Can we see",
    "start": 2578.56,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "at depth",
    "start": 2581.92,
    "duration": 5.439
  },
  {
    "text": "what would make others happy? What would",
    "start": 2584.0,
    "duration": 8.48
  },
  {
    "text": "help them thrive? Can we observe",
    "start": 2587.359,
    "duration": 8.081
  },
  {
    "text": "within families or groups or",
    "start": 2592.48,
    "duration": 4.48
  },
  {
    "text": "organizations",
    "start": 2595.44,
    "duration": 4.08
  },
  {
    "text": "and discern what might be helpful? What",
    "start": 2596.96,
    "duration": 5.359
  },
  {
    "text": "might lead to the alleviation of",
    "start": 2599.52,
    "duration": 9.16
  },
  {
    "text": "suffering, the promotion of flourishing?",
    "start": 2602.319,
    "duration": 6.361
  },
  {
    "text": "This is the province of wisdom.",
    "start": 2609.76,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And because we understand duka,",
    "start": 2614.16,
    "duration": 7.0
  },
  {
    "text": "the unquenchability,",
    "start": 2617.76,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "and because we understand our the",
    "start": 2621.2,
    "duration": 4.56
  },
  {
    "text": "architecture of our nervous system,",
    "start": 2623.839,
    "duration": 5.441
  },
  {
    "text": "because we've collected so much data,",
    "start": 2625.76,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "because we understand the homelessness",
    "start": 2629.28,
    "duration": 5.839
  },
  {
    "text": "of ego,",
    "start": 2632.0,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "we can make better",
    "start": 2635.119,
    "duration": 6.761
  },
  {
    "text": "predictions about the future.",
    "start": 2637.52,
    "duration": 4.36
  },
  {
    "text": "And this",
    "start": 2642.64,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "helps us um get more of what we want,",
    "start": 2644.64,
    "duration": 8.719
  },
  {
    "text": "truly want,",
    "start": 2650.64,
    "duration": 8.679
  },
  {
    "text": "and give others more of what they need.",
    "start": 2653.359,
    "duration": 5.96
  },
  {
    "text": "Offer this for your consideration.",
    "start": 2662.319,
    "duration": 5.241
  },
  {
    "text": "Okay. May we uh live well today. See you",
    "start": 2669.28,
    "duration": 7.079
  },
  {
    "text": "uh see you tomorrow.",
    "start": 2672.72,
    "duration": 3.639
  }
]